<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand rises.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of foreign exchange as follows at its weekly auction held on July 23:</p>
<p>					    23 July	    17 July</p>
<p>Amount sold (million)		     $31.107	    $24.614</p>
<p>Dollar exchange rate	     83.2 naira	 83.5 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
